1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hedevig Ulrikke von Pfuel
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the local church books, she was died or buried the 9th of june 1790. She is first just added as Genraless (Generaldine) Lowzow, as in that she was married to general Lowzow. But later information about her has been ad
2 CONC ded one. Who she was and who her husband was, plus things I can't decipher. More in the church book from Vang i Hedmark. Can be found in a scanned version at Digitalarkivet. 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to my family writings she was born in Reibnitz, Pommeren, Germany. I am not sure if it's the same Reibnitz as the one that now says in the information about her.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: A. W. von Pfuhl
