1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''August Johan Hartvig Ernst greve von Bernstorff''', til Lanken & Wotersen, Kammerherre, Major (Husarerne) ( Hæren - Forsvaret ). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born on 5 Apr 1767. He died on 15 May 1791. He married Constance Henriette Frederikke lensgrevinde Knuth-Gyldensteen af Knuthenborg til Grevskabet Gyldensteen on 2 Aug 1790.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Andreas Erich Heinrich Ernst lensgreve Bernstorff-Gyldensteen til Grevskabet Gyldensteen was born on 26 Apr 1791. He died on 4 Oct 1837. 
2 CONT
