1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Joachim Friedrich "Frederik" greve Bernstorff''', til Neuendorf; 1790 imm. i Kiel, derefter i Göttingen, 1793 (16 Aug.) Sekretær i udenlandske Departement, 1797 Kammerherre, 1798 (27 April) afsk., 1800 4. Depute
2 CONC ret i Tyske Kancelli (14 Marts) og (1 Aug.) Direktør for det udenlandske Departement, 1808 (9 Febr.) S'K' 1810 (27 April) afsk., 1813 Sendebud i London, 1814 ved Wienerkongressen, 1816 (11 Okt.) Envoyé i Wien, 1835 (17 Marts) Ridd
2 CONC er af Elefanten, afsk. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born on 5 Oct 1771. He died on 26 Oct 1835. He married Elisabeth Sophie Henriette von Blücher til Lindewith on 9 May 1795. Joachim was employed as Gehejmeraad, Gesandt ( Ambassadør ) i Østrig, Direktør i Departementet i Ude
2 CONC nlandske Anliggender.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Sophie Henriette von Blücher til Lindewith was born on 15 May 1770. She died on 29 Jan 1809. She married Joachim Friedrich "Frederik" greve Bernstorff til Neuendorff on 9 May 1795.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # Henriette Sophie Auguste Charlotte comtesse Bernstorff was born on 25 Sep 1803. 
2 CONT # Mariane Amalie comtesse Bernstorff was born on 12 Feb 1805. She died on 6 Sep 1831. 
2 CONT # Sophie comtesse Bernstorff was born on 29 Jan 1807. She died on 7 Mar 1857. 
2 CONT
