1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Toll_nr_314#TAB_17 '''Osvald Georg ''Edvard'' Toll'''], född 1864-05-20 i Hälsingborg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Med. doktor'''. Läkare vid Chicago Policlinic and Hospital. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 1906'''-07-01 med '''Berthe Hagen'''.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Emigrated to the United States in 1890. Studied medicine at the Medical department of the University of St Louis, Mo and University of Vienna, Austria. After his return to Chicago he did post-graduate work in the Polyclinic Gradua
2 CONC te School. Received his MD degree from St. Louis College of Physicians and Surgeons. Served as assistant physician at the Lake Geneva Sanatorium and 1907-12 held the same position in surgery at the Chicago Polyclinic School and in
2 CONC  the Medical Department of Chicago University..
