1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kilde: Wikipeida: https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amalie_Christiane_Raben: Amalie Christiane Raben, gift Juel (4. august 1736 i København – 1. august 1803 på Juelsberg) var en dansk adelsdame, gift med Carl Juel og G
2 CONC regers Christian Juel og mor til Hans Rudolph Juel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hun var datter af Christian Frederik Raben og Berte Scheel von Plessen. Hun var hofdame hos hos prinsesserne Vilhelmine Caroline og Louise og blev 1763 dame de l'union parfaite.
2 CONT
2 CONT 24. marts 1762 ægtede hun i Christiansborg Slotskirke gehejmeråd Carl Juel og 28. september 1770 ægtede hun på Valdemars Slot senere gehejmeråd Gregers Christian Juel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hun er begravet i Aunslev Kirke.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Amalie Christiane Raben christened in Christiansborg Slotskirke, 1761 Lady-in-waiting to Princesses Wilhelmine, Caroline and Louise, 1763 dame de l'union parfaite. Married 1) -  24 Mar 1762 at Christiansborg Slot to Whit
2 CONC e Ridder Carl Juel, born 22 Jun 1706 of the family Taasinge, died 1 Sep 1767. Married 2) - 28 Sep 1770 to Gregers Christian Juel of the family Hverringe, born 16 Nov 1738, died 4 Nov 1776 in Hamburg, buried 9 Nov 1776 at St. Nicol
2 CONC ai Church in Kiel. Her first husband Carl Juel had 2 previous marriages. He was married 16 Aug 1738 to Christiane Louise Henriette von Schleinitz She died in 1756. He was later married on 24 Mar 1759 to Anna Margarethe Juel, born 
2 CONC 18 Sep 1741, died 8 May 1761.
