1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Christine Sophie Collett 
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 børn, including: Christine Sophie, who was known as Stinchen, was born (Sic.) on 24.02.1726 and she later married Hieronimus Johann Schultze.  Tragically, Christine died on 06.04.1756 before they had any children, while Hieroni
2 CONC mus, who was born in 1716, survived for another forty-seven years before he died on 27.09.1803.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Ministerialbok===
2 CONT
