1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Johanne Elise Berge (Cappelen Smith)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Hanna as she was called at home, was married to the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheriff Sheriff] of [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Troms%C3%B8 Tromsø], Ole Christian Berge. They were married on the 24th of April 1848 in [http://e
2 CONC n.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asker Asker], a present day suburb of [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oslo Oslo]. Together they had four children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband: [http://www.geni.com/people/Ole-Berge/6000000008418686364 Ole Christian Berge, Sheriff]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Karen-Esbensen/6000000008418484016 Karen Cappelen Esbensen (Berge)] 
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Trine-Berge/6000000008573273141 Trine Marie Berge]
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Ole-Berge/6000000008573470701 Ole Christian Berge]
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Antonette-Berge/6000000008573536586 Antonette Caroline Fredrikke Lovise Berge]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources===
2 CONT
2 CONT * disnorge.no: [http://www.disnorge.no/slektsforum/viewtopic.php?t=77100 Elias Smith, fra Drammen, ordfører i Bærum?]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Grave stone: [http://www.disnorge.no/gravminner/korrigering.php?id=3244867 Johanne Elise Berge (Smith)]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Death date 2 Jun 1894 - buried Tromsø gravlund, Tromsø  - [http://www.disnorge.no/gravminner/global1.php Johanne Elise Berge (Smith)].
2 CONT
