1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Emanuel joined the Swedish army in 1686 and became Trabant Guard in 1687, Kornett (second lieutenant)  in Vestgöta Cavalry Regiment in 1691. He was naturalized Swedish nobleman in 1692 under nbr 1300, promoted to "
2 CONC regementskvartermästare" (rank superior of lieutenant but inferior of captain) and 1701 to Ryttmästare (equivalent to Captain), Ryttmästare in "1st Lif-Regementet till Häst" onwards of 1706, Became POW after the battle of  Pultava
2 CONC  in September 1709 and was sent to Solikamski, Siberia. He returned home in 1722 after the peace agreement and was promoted to Öfverste-Lieutenant (Colonel-lieutenant). He retired in 1736 and died in the same year. He had no child
2 CONC ren and therefore his title as a nobleman had no continuation.    
