0 @N6000000002176689364@ NOTE The 11th daughter of Francis I and Maria Theresa was frivalous and impudent.
1 CONT Her husband's permitting her to unduly influence him was a major factor in
1 CONT his downfall as the last Bourbon monarch before the 1789 French Revolution, a
1 CONT revolution called by the National Convention (elected French deputies) due
1 CONT primarily to a bankrupt French government. Both she and her husband were
1 CONT guillotined for "counterrevolution".
